head(
# WITCH

You command powerful magic, not through study or devotion, but as an agent for an
otherworldly patron that even you don't entirely understand. Through a special
familiar, your patron grants you versatile spells and powerful hexes to use as you
see fit, though you're never certain if you're merely serving a larger plan.
)

info(
# Key Attribute

## Intelligence

At 1st level, your class gives you an attribute boost to Intelligence.

|

# Hit Points

## 6 plus your Constitution modifier

You increase your maximum number of HP by this number at 1st level and every level
thereafter.
)

## During combat encounters...

You cast spells to change the course of battle, using magical hexes to hamper
enemies and aid allies, while leveraging more powerful spells to control the
battlefield, aided by your extraordinary familiar.

## During social encounters...

You provide knowledge on numerous topics, and you might call upon your patron's
magic to charm or deceive others.

## While exploring...

You remain alert for magical traps and treasures, employing a clever array of
spells to overcome the obstacles that stand in your way.

## In downtime...

You brew potions, craft other magical items, or hunt for new spells for your
familiar to learn.

## You might...

* Strive to learn more about your patron or familiar.
* Seek out new sources of magic, like scrolls and spellbooks.

sidebar(
# Initial Proficiencies

At 1st level, you gain the listed proficiency ranks. You are untrained in anything
not listed unless you gain a better rank in some other way.

## Perception

Trained in Perception

## Saving Throws

Trained in Fortitude

Trained in Reflex

Expert in Will

## Skills

Trained in one skill determined by your patron

Trained in a number of additional skills equal to 3 plus your Intelligence modifier

## Attacks

Trained in simple weapons

Trained in unarmed attacks

## Defenses

Untrained in all armor

Trained in unarmored defense

## Spells

Trained in spell attack modifier

Trained in spell DC

## Class DC

Trained in witch class DC
)
